routing.home-inbox-reply-drafter:
# AGENTS

When a message should not be drafted by this team:
  @Triage Lead, please keep this on the human list with my note attached.
When a draft needs the history behind a claim:
  @Thread Reader, please confirm what the thread says about this point.

routing.home-inbox-subscription-auditor:
# AGENTS

When the unsubscribe list is ready for a decision:
  @Triage Lead, please put this list in front of the reader with the counts.
When a sender should be kept despite low opens:
  @Triage Lead, please confirm this exception so I stop proposing it.

routing.home-inbox-thread-reader:
# AGENTS

When a thread's summary shows it needs a real reply:
  @Triage Lead, please place this on the reply list with the ask I extracted.
When the reply is short and the state is clear:
  @Reply Drafter, please draft from this summary and keep the commitments intact.

routing.home-inbox-triage-lead:
# AGENTS

When a thread is too long to judge from its last message:
  @Thread Reader, please summarise this thread and say what decision it is waiting on.
When a reply is short and obvious:
  @Reply Drafter, please draft this one for approval.
When a sender keeps arriving and never gets opened:
  @Subscription Auditor, please add this sender to the unsubscribe review.
